IC\"","\"proxy\"","\"net_cash_capex_less_DA\"","\"delta_onwc\"","\"delta_capital_advance\"","\"delta_security_deposit\"","\"less_delta_long_gratuity\"","\"fixed_asset_disposal_reclassification_non_cash_residual\"","\"bridge_sum\"","\"lagged_proxy_FY24to26_NOPAT_over_FY23to25_IC\"","\"five_year\"","\"limitations\"","\"5.356575\"","\"8.9691\"","\"0.597225474127838913603371575743385624\"","\"1.3806\"","\"6.2426\"","\"0.4875\"","\"0.2538\"","\"0.0022\"","\"1.75312538680529768535709865082312167\"","\"Marginal/accountingproxy, notprojectIRR. FY23profittrough, FY24receivableliquidation,oldassetdepreciation,reclassifications anduncommissionedcapitaldistort. Includescapitaladvance/depositsnotjustPPE. Three-yearcashcapexdoesnotexactlyreconcilefixedmovement: residualshownnotburied.\"","\"IC\"","\"gross_profit\"","\"working_capital_days\"","\"FCF\"","\"AR+inventory+operatingadvances−AP−operatingcurrentliabilities−currentgratuity/CSR + netPPE/intangibles+CWIP+capitaladvances+securitydeposits−longgratuity. Financingcrosscheck:equity+debt+nettaxprovision−cash−FD−DTA−IPOprepaid. Roundingresidualretained. FY23/FY24interestandcapitalcreditors0.2485/0.0345areexcludedfromONWCandaddedasfundingclaims;FY23income-taxasset0.0128excludedfromIC. Minorroundingdifferencesretained.\"","\"ND as fullconsistentindustrialgrossprofit; value-addedproxy excludeslabor,power,overheads andisnotgrossmargin.\"","\"Averagebalances, revenueproxyforcreditsales; material/trade/inventory-changeCOGSproxyexcludeslabor/power. Notcomparabletoissuerclosingbalancebudgetdays.\"","\"ReportedCFO−cashPPE/intangiblecapex; interestclassifiedfinancing, capitaladvanceadditionalcashuse, allleasesrentinoperations. No fabricatedIndASlease.\"","\"uncertainty\"","\"terms\"","\"known_contribution\"","\"missing_weight\"","\"coverage\"","\"raw\"","\"final\"","\"display\"","\"raw_bounds\"","\"cap\"","\"applied_overrides\"","\"confidence\"","\"ranking_eligible\"","\"factor\"","\"score\"","\"weight\"","\"contribution\"","\"GOV\"","\"4\"","\"0.20\"","\"0.80\"","\"MOAT\"","\"REV\"","\"0.12\"","\"DUR\"","\"5\"","\"0.10\"","\"0.50\"","\"CAP\"","\"6\"","\"0.72\"","\"CASH\"","\"BAL\"","\"0.08\"","\"0.40\"","\"EXEC\"","\"0.32\"","\"4.04\"","\"0.88\"","\"4.16\"","\"5.24\"","\"Low for completeaggregate; knownfactorjudgmentsMedium\"","false","\"1.00\"","\"EARN\"","\"0.15\"","\"0.90\"","\"3.30\"","\"0.60\"","\"3.70\"","\"7.30\"","\"propagated_BQS_bounds\"","\"0.25\"","\"R\"","\"0.35\"","\"D\"","\"P\"","\"L\"","\"0.00\"","\"10.00\"","\"1.7900\"","\"8.8100\"","\"two_borderline_factors\"","\"BQS_known_contribution_movement_each_plus_minus1\"","\"GQS_known_contribution_movement_CAP_plus_minus1\"","\"rule\"","\".32\"","\".15\"","\"No pointscoresemergefromsensitivity. Boundsmathematicalnotconfidenceintervals; nohiddenhaircuts.\"","\"overrides\"","\"code\"","\"evidence\"","\"history_ceiling\"","4","\"Medium\"","\"E06,E08,E09,E11,E13\"","\"Family control, related-party property and demand loans, legacy licensing failure and recurrent bank-reporting differences. No proved material abuse/default; subsequent IFC improvement is contrary favorable evidence.\"","8","\"E02,E03,E04,S11,S13,S15\"","\"Specialized process and product qualification may create friction, but verified pricing premium, retention, market share and exclusive IP are missing; direct competitors offer similar meshes.\"","\"Low\"","\"E02,E03\"","\"Reported and manufactured three-year rupee growth are calculable. Nickel pass-through, trading mix and absent sold-volume/price bridge prevent a reliable underlying-demand basis. Profit growth is not substituted.\"","5","\"E03,E04,E05\"","\"Replacement consumables and planned capacity provide a conditional runway; no firm demand commitments or independently verified customer qualification. Manufacturing growth has slowed.\"","\"E10,E12\"","\"Historical operating returns improved and the incremental proxy is positive, but the profit trough, receivable liquidation, depreciated assets and uncommissioned capital prevent a persistent high-return conclusion.\"","\"E07,E12\"","\"Three-year CFO/PAT is0.9883, four-year conversion is above1. FY26 is only43.90%, with receivable/inventory absorption and additional capital advance. One weak year alone does not trigger the persistent<=3 override.\"","\"E10,E14\"","\"Historical leverage ratios appear moderate, but unrestricted cash is tiny, promoter loans are payable on demand and solar debt/reserved IPO proceeds complicate liquidity. Current solvency is not certified.\"","\"E03,E05,E06,commitment_outcomes.json\"","\"Narol compliance closure is adverse; later audit controls improved. DRHP commissioning shifted two months and working-capital forecasts were mixed. New capacity is not yet delivery.\"","\"E02,E07,E12\"","\"Restated profit improvement is supported, but trading/mix, other income, lower finance cost and cash lag limit quality. Original/restated differences remain visible.\"","\"E14,E15\"","\"Actual October cash and forecast economics are not established. A mechanical return score of1 from the conditional model would be unsupported.\"","\"Linked bear funding failure is identified, but actual cash, spending dates and committed financing are unresolved. Model failure is not proved issuer default.\"","\"E02,E14,E15\"","\"Reverse/capacity diagnostics are available, but demand economics and primary market inputs are incomplete; no supported expectations score.\"","\"E15\"","\"Primary20/60-session traded value, spread, zero-session and restriction evidence is missing. Lot constraints are established, but no executable exit estimate.\"","\"gate\"","\"resolve\"","\"Obtain compliance closure, arm’s-length RPT terms, beneficial ownership and encumbrance verification.\"","\"Reconcile original/restated cash flow, fixed-asset registers and borrowing-base statements.\"","\"Obtain bank statements, drawdowns, purpose utilization, dated maturities, covenants and committed funding.\"","\"Obtain primary traded values, missing/zero-session distinction, lot, spread, circuits and available free float.\"","\"legal_name\"","\"former_name\"","\"CIN\"","\"ISIN\"","\"exchange\"","\"symbol\"","\"scrip\"","\"listing_date\"","\"listing_date_confidence\"","\"scope\"","\"issued_shares\"","\"preIPO_shares\"","\"IPO_shares\"","\"authorized_shares\"","\"lot\"","\"face_value\"","\"promoter_shares\"","\"promoter_group_shares\"","\"nonpromoter_shares\"","\"share_count_source\"","\"pledges\"","\"dilutive_instruments\"","\"master_rows\"","\"warning\"","\"Roopa Screen Private Limited\"","\"U28112GJ2013PLC074471\"","\"BSE SME\"","\"ROOPA\"","\"2026-10-01\"","\"Secondary corroboration; primarylistingPDFinaccessible\"","\"Standalone IndianGAAP AS; subsidiaries/JVnone disclosed\"","11067500","3000000","12000000","2000","\"10\"","6875750","175000","4016750","\"S01capital/S19master\"","\"ND atcutoff; notzero\"","\"No warrants/options/convertibles disclosedinreviewedprospectus; speculativefutureequityonlyexplicitcappedmodel\"","\"series\"","\"listed_shares\"","\"low_band\"","\"high_band\"","\"ROOPA$\"","\"SM\"","\"81.60\"","\"122.40\"","\"ST\"","\"101.13\"","\"111.77\"","\"MasterSM/STfieldsconflict; notbasisforclaimcurrentBSErestriction. Nonpromoterfractionnotimmediatelytradablefreefloat.\"","\"price\"","\"price_date\"","\"quote_type\"","\"market_cap\"","\"position_reference_rupees\"","\"two_lots_shares\"","\"two_lots_cost\"","\"three_lots_cost\"","\"secondary_rows\"","\"actual_traded_value\"","\"20_session_mean_median\"","\"60_session_mean_median\"","\"zero_trade_days\"","\"spread\"","\"circuits\"","\"restrictions\"","\"participation\"","\"exit_days\"","\"formula\"","\"Secondary reportedclose, notexecutablequote\"","\"S17\"","\"S18\"","\"112.8885\"","500000","4000","\"408000\"","\"612000\"","\"date\"","\"close\"","\"volume\"","92000","\"2026-10-16\"","\"102.73\"","50000","\"2026-10-15\"","\"104.52\"","46000","\"2026-10-14\"","\"106.45\"","52000","\"2026-10-13\"","\"105.54\"","\"2026-10-12\"","\"104.03\"","104000","\"2026-10-09\"","\"102.75\"","40000","\"2026-10-08\"","\"105.60\"","80000","\"2026-10-07\"","\"111.15\"","164000","\"ND, do not use close*volume as actualturnover\"","\"ND, missing notzero; prelistingdays NA\"","\"ND primaryhistory\"","\"PrimarycurrentrecordND; secondaryMT-to-M16Oct and20%bandnotcertified\"","\".02\"","\".05\"","\".10\"","\"2%\"","\"5%\"","\"10%\"","\"position_value/(participation*min(60sessionmean,60sessionmedian)); missing denominator=>NS, notzero/finiteestimate\"","\"id\"","\"type\"","\"subject\"","\"finding\"","\"E01\"","\"V\"","\"Identity and capital\"","\"S01 cover/capital pp60–73; S19\"","\"Roopa Screen Limited, INE2BTZ01011, BSE SME544954 ROOPA; no substitution of Roopa Industries. Standalone AS, no subsidiaries/JV or disclosed warrants/options. 8,067,500 preIPO +3,000,000 fresh =11,067,500 postIPO shares; authorized12,000,000. Bonus6:1 on22Sep2025 is comparability adjustment, not value creation.\"","\"High\"","\"E02\"","\"Core manufacturing versus trading\"","\"S01 business and Annex21 pp187–189; S02 revenue annex20\"","\"FY24/FY25/FY26 manufacturing35.1890/39.8975/42.0734cr; nickel trade0.4596/5.3637/8.5650; freight0.0566/0.0800/0.0888. Nickel trading is low-value-added, without processing; manufactured demand price/volume split not disclosed.\"","\"E03\"","\"Capacity and closure\"","\"S01 risks/business/manufacturing; S10\"","\"Current Sanand74400 annual screens, FY26 output71800. Narol closed15Dec2025 for absent factory licence/GPCB consent; FY266800 output from that closed site is not continuing capacity. Total production78600 includes both; produced units are not sold units. Proposed addition88800 gives163200 total only after commissioning.\"","\"E04\"","\"Concentration\"","\"S01 business tables\"","\"FY26 top10 customers34.53%, top10 suppliers96.73%; customer count210 versus228FY25 and205FY24. Domestic99.69%, Gujarat58.93%, top5states96.58%, Penta38.54% revenue. No firm customer purchase commitments.\"","\"E05\"","\"IPO and expansion\"","\"S01 objects pp73–91; S10\"","\"Gross19.2cr, fee3.2773, net15.9227. Project10.6098 includes civil2.9757/plant6.7188/electrical0.4101/contingency0.5052;0.20 cheque2Jul2026; IPO9.9046, internal0.5052. WC6cr; GCP0.0181. Remaining fees2.7584 afterMarch prepaid0.5189. Proposed commissioningMarch2027, not achieved at cutoff; not bank-appraised, audit committee monitoring.\"","\"E06\"","\"Original audit coverage and auditor transition\"","\"S03/S04 audit/CARO; S05 complete pp1–10; S06 pp1–9; S08\"","\"Original FY24 unmodified but CARO proper PPE/intangible records under process, IFC exempt not affirmative assurance. FY25 andFY26 unmodified, proper PPE records, affirmative IFC and operational audit trail in respective years. FY25 CARO says auditor resigned: Ashok K Bhatt3Jul2025 other commitments; GMCS appointed21Jul2025. No scope-limitation allegation found. FY26 no resignation/default/fraud reported.\"","\"E07\"","\"Original/restated differences retained\"","\"S04 pp12–14; S05 p13; S07 p3; S01 pp170–172\"","\"Original FY24 CFO5.4391078 versusrestated5.8645; original openingcash0.1000429 versusrestated0.25, sameending0.1960. FY23 original CFO2.9453621 versusrestated3.2934. DRHP printed191 Annex18 shows FY23 cash10.00lakh plus FD<3months15.00lakh, explaining restated cash-equivalent inclusion; no complete CFO reclassification bridge located. Original FY24 revenue35.7239776 vs35.7053 andPAT1.4402628 vs1.5036. Restatement explains gratuity, auditfee, tax, depreciation and deferredtax. Original FY25 CFO3.8086; FY26 comparative3.8088; restated3.8131. FY26 original CFO2.8484,capex1.4263,D&A1.2395 versusrestated2.8464,1.4243,1.2375; samecash0.068. Do not force these differences to zero.\"","\"E08\"","\"Bank statement differences\"","\"S05 CARO; S06 CARO p7\"","\"FY25 bank stock/current-asset statement893.85lakh versusbooks1000.77, difference106.92/10.68%; FY26 bank1424.18 versusbooks1500.25 difference76.07/5.07%. Auditors explain chemicals/packing omitted and non-goods liabilities included. Not